# Measuring 6 gloops into the 9-gloop vial with only a 9- and a 4-gloop
# vial to work with: fill the 9, decant 4 into the 4-gloop vial twice
# (dumping it each time) to leave 1 in the 9-gloop vial, pour that 1
# into the (now empty) 4-gloop vial, then refill the 9-gloop vial and
# top the 4-gloop vial off from it -- which only needs 3 more gloops
# since it already holds 1, leaving 9-3=6 behind.

fill 9-gloop vial
fill 4-gloop vial from 9-gloop vial
empty 4-gloop vial
fill 4-gloop vial from 9-gloop vial
empty 4-gloop vial
pour 9-gloop vial into 4-gloop vial
fill 9-gloop vial
fill 4-gloop vial from 9-gloop vial

